; A `@` or `@@` cost with no posting before it to price is an argument
; error, as for every other preposition missing its operand.  It used
; to dereference a null posting pointer (SIGSEGV).

2024/01/01 Opening Balance
    Assets:Checking                  $1,000.00
    Equity:Opening Balances

test xact 2024/01/02 Broker @ '$5' -> 1
__ERROR__
Error: Invalid xact command arguments
end test

test template Broker @@ '$50' -> 1
__ERROR__
Error: Invalid xact command arguments
end test

test xact @ '$5' Broker -> 1
__ERROR__
Error: Invalid xact command arguments
end test
